From f5bf24fcae8377d826c39d2476f155d78d71b4ae Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 13:07:59 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] mining pool: add exact configurable operator commission

Add ordinary ABC poolfeepercent option, default zero; parse fixed decimal percent into integer basis points. Deduct floor commission only from the existing miner slice, retain worker remainder and immutable per-job terms, and pay the explicit native pooladdress. No parser, consensus or persistence changes.
